  "description": "A lightweight .NET wrapper around WebKitGTK, providing a browser UI component for desktop Linux apps.\n\n            Features:\n            - Splash screen overlay during page loading\n            - JavaScript to C# bridge via postMessage\n            - Strict mode to prevent external navigation\n            - Context menu disabling for kiosk-style apps\n            - Developer tools support (DebugMode)\n            - Optional blocking of text selection\n            - Safe GTK shutdown with CancellationToken\n\n            Requires the following system packages:\n            - libgtk-3-dev\n            - libwebkit2gtk-4.0-dev\n            - libjavascriptcoregtk-4.1-dev\n            - libgdk-pixbuf2.0-dev\n            - libglib2.0-dev",
  "iconFile": "images\\128x128.png",
